##
## Provenance
##
## This project combines pieces of two earlier projects by the same author:
##
##   - registry.c/.h, scanner.c/.h, grammar.c/.h, ast.c/.h, ast_node.c/.h,
##     parser.c/.h, file.c/.h, color.c/.h, repl.c/.h, token.def and
##     syntax.def are adapted from flexible-parser, with MemPool replaced by
##     the arena from db4 (see below). scanner.c/.h in flexible-parser in
##     turn descends from Crafting Interpreters by Robert Nystrom
##     (https://craftinginterpreters.com), hence the second copyright line
##     above.
##
##   - arena.c/.h and budget.c/.h are taken from db4 unmodified.
##
## external/linenoise is a vendored third-party dependency, under its own
## license - see THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES/linenoise-LICENSE.txt.
##
